) VALUES (
    'cortina-dampezzo-venue-guide',
    '{"en": "Cortina d''Ampezzo: Queen of the Dolomites", "de": "Cortina d''Ampezzo: Königin der Dolomiten", "fr": "Cortina d''Ampezzo : Reine des Dolomites", "it": "Cortina d''Ampezzo: Regina delle Dolomiti", "es": "Cortina d''Ampezzo: Reina de los Dolomitas", "pt": "Cortina d''Ampezzo: Rainha das Dolomitas", "nl": "Cortina d''Ampezzo: Koningin van de Dolomieten", "ar": "كورتينا دامبيتزو: ملكة الدولوميت", "ja": "コルティナ・ダンペッツォ：ドロミテの女王", "zh": "Cortina d''Ampezzo: Duoluomite Nvwang", "ko": "코르티나 담페초: 돌로미테의 여왕"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "This legendary Italian resort in the heart of the Dolomites offers some of the most spectacular alpine scenery in the world. A historic winter sports destination.", "de": "Dieses legendäre italienische Resort im Herzen der Dolomiten bietet einige der spektakulärsten Alpenlandschaften der Welt.", "fr": "Cette station italienne légendaire au coeur des Dolomites offre certains des paysages alpins les plus spectaculaires au monde.", "it": "Questa leggendaria località italiana nel cuore delle Dolomiti offre alcuni dei paesaggi alpini più spettacolari al mondo.", "es": "Este legendario resort italiano en el corazón de los Dolomitas ofrece algunos de los paisajes alpinos más espectaculares del mundo.", "pt": "Este lendário resort italiano no coração das Dolomitas oferece algumas das paisagens alpinas mais espetaculares do mundo.", "nl": "Dit legendarische Italiaanse resort in het hart van de Dolomieten biedt enkele van de meest spectaculaire Alpenlandschappen ter wereld.", "ar": "يقدم هذا المنتجع الإيطالي الأسطوري في قلب الدولوميت بعضاً من أروع المناظر الجبلية في العالم", "ja": "ドロミテの中心にあるこの伝説的なイタリアのリゾートは、世界で最も壮観なアルプスの景色を提供します。", "zh": "Zhe ge chuanqi de Yidali dujiacun weizhi Duoluomite zhongxin, tigong shijie shang zui zhuangguan de gaoshan fengjing.", "ko": "돌로미테 중심부에 위치한 이 전설적인 이탈리아 리조트는 세계에서 가장 장관인 알프스 경치를 제공합니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Cortina d''Ampezzo stands as one of the most prestigious winter sports destinations in the world. Nestled in the Italian Dolomites, this historic resort combines natural beauty with a rich sporting heritage that spans nearly a century.</p><h2>Location and Setting</h2><p>The town sits at approximately 1,224 meters elevation in the Veneto region of northern Italy. The surrounding Dolomite peaks, a UNESCO World Heritage site, create a dramatic backdrop of towering rock formations and pristine alpine terrain.</p><p>The unique pink-tinged color of the Dolomite rock at sunset, known as the \"Enrosadira,\" makes Cortina one of the most photogenic ski destinations on Earth.</p><h2>Alpine Skiing Heritage</h2><p>Cortina has hosted <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpine skiing</a> events at the highest level for decades. The resort''s challenging courses test the world''s best skiers in downhill, super-G, and other speed events.</p><p>Athletes like <a href=\"/sofia-goggia-profile/\">Sofia Goggia</a> and <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> have competed here against the stunning Dolomite backdrop.</p><h2>The Courses</h2><p>The Olympia delle Tofane course serves as the primary venue for women''s speed events, featuring technical sections that challenge even the most experienced racers. The demanding terrain rewards aggressive skiing while punishing mistakes.</p><h2>Spectator Experience</h2><p>Watching skiing in Cortina offers a unique experience. The town''s charming center, historic hotels, and excellent restaurants make it a complete destination. Spectators can enjoy world-class racing and then explore the elegant shops and cafes along the Corso Italia.</p><h2>Getting There</h2><p>Cortina is accessible from Venice Marco Polo Airport (about 2 hours by car) or Innsbruck Airport in Austria. The scenic drive through the mountains is part of the experience, though winter driving requires appropriate preparation.</p><h2>Accommodation</h2><p>From luxury hotels to cozy mountain lodges, Cortina offers accommodation for every budget. Booking well in advance is essential during major events, as the resort attracts visitors from around the world.</p>", "de": "<p>Cortina d''Ampezzo ist eines der renommiertesten Wintersportziele der Welt. Eingebettet in die italienischen Dolomiten, verbindet dieses historische Resort natürliche Schönheit mit einem reichen sportlichen Erbe.</p><h2>Lage und Umgebung</h2><p>Die Stadt liegt auf etwa 1.224 Metern Höhe in der Region Venetien im Norden Italiens. Die umliegenden Dolomitengipfel, UNESCO-Welterbe, schaffen eine dramatische Kulisse.</p><h2>Ski-Alpin-Erbe</h2><p>Cortina hat seit Jahrzehnten <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">Ski-Alpin</a>-Events auf höchstem Niveau ausgerichtet.</p><h2>Zuschauererlebnis</h2><p>Das Skifahren in Cortina zu beobachten bietet ein einzigartiges Erlebnis.</p>", "fr": "<p>Cortina d''Ampezzo est l''une des destinations de sports d''hiver les plus prestigieuses au monde. Nichée dans les Dolomites italiennes, cette station historique combine beauté naturelle et riche patrimoine sportif.</p><h2>Emplacement et cadre</h2><p>La ville est située à environ 1 224 mètres d''altitude dans la région de Vénétie, au nord de l''Italie. Les sommets des Dolomites environnants, site du patrimoine mondial de l''UNESCO, créent un décor spectaculaire.</p><h2>Patrimoine du ski alpin</h2><p>Cortina accueille des événements de <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">ski alpin</a> au plus haut niveau depuis des décennies.</p>", "it": "<p>Cortina d''Ampezzo è una delle destinazioni di sport invernali più prestigiose al mondo. Immersa nelle Dolomiti italiane, questa storica località combina bellezza naturale e un ricco patrimonio sportivo.</p><h2>Posizione e ambiente</h2><p>La città si trova a circa 1.224 metri di altitudine nella regione del Veneto, nel nord Italia. Le cime dolomitiche circostanti, patrimonio mondiale dell''UNESCO, creano uno scenario drammatico di imponenti formazioni rocciose.</p><h2>Patrimonio dello sci alpino</h2><p>Cortina ospita eventi di <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">sci alpino</a> al massimo livello da decenni.</p>", "es": "<p>Cortina d''Ampezzo es uno de los destinos de deportes de invierno más prestigiosos del mundo. Ubicada en los Dolomitas italianos, este histórico resort combina belleza natural con un rico patrimonio deportivo.</p><h2>Ubicación y entorno</h2><p>La ciudad se encuentra a aproximadamente 1.224 metros de altitud en la región del Véneto, en el norte de Italia.</p><h2>Patrimonio del esquí alpino</h2><p>Cortina ha albergado eventos de <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">esquí alpino</a> al más alto nivel durante décadas.</p>", "pt": "<p>Cortina d''Ampezzo é um dos destinos de esportes de inverno mais prestigiados do mundo. Localizada nas Dolomitas italianas, este resort histórico combina beleza natural com um rico patrimônio esportivo.</p><h2>Localização e cenário</h2><p>A cidade fica a aproximadamente 1.224 metros de altitude na região do Veneto, no norte da Itália.</p><h2>Patrimônio do esqui alpino</h2><p>Cortina sediou eventos de <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">esqui alpino</a> no mais alto nível por décadas.</p>", "nl": "<p>Cortina d''Ampezzo is een van de meest prestigieuze wintersportbestemmingen ter wereld. Genesteld in de Italiaanse Dolomieten combineert dit historische resort natuurlijke schoonheid met een rijk sportief erfgoed.</p><h2>Locatie en omgeving</h2><p>De stad ligt op ongeveer 1.224 meter hoogte in de regio Veneto in het noorden van Italië.</p><h2>Alpineski erfgoed</h2><p>Cortina organiseert al decennia <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpineski</a> evenementen op het hoogste niveau.</p>", "ar": "<p>تعد كورتينا دامبيتزو واحدة من أرقى وجهات الرياضات الشتوية في العالم. تقع في جبال الدولوميت الإيطالية، وتجمع هذه المنتجع التاريخي بين الجمال الطبيعي والتراث الرياضي الغني.</p><h2>الموقع والإطار</h2><p>تقع المدينة على ارتفاع حوالي 1224 متراً في منطقة فينيتو شمال إيطاليا.</p><h2>تراث التزلج الألبي</h2><p>استضافت كورتينا فعاليات <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">التزلج الألبي</a> على أعلى مستوى لعقود.</p>", "ja": "<p>コルティナ・ダンペッツォは、世界で最も権威ある冬季スポーツの目的地の一つです。イタリアのドロミテに位置するこの歴史あるリゾートは、自然の美しさと豊かなスポーツの遺産を兼ね備えています。</p><h2>立地と環境</h2><p>町は北イタリアのヴェネト州、標高約1,224メートルに位置しています。</p><h2>アルペンスキーの遺産</h2><p>コルティナは数十年にわたり、最高レベルの<a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">アルペンスキー</a>イベントを開催してきました。</p>", "zh": "<p>Cortina d''Ampezzo shi shijie shang zui fuyu shengwang de dongji yundong mudi zhiyi. Weizhi Yidali Duoluomite, zhe ge lishi youjiu de dujiacun jiehe le ziran meili he fengfu de tiyu yichan.</p><h2>Weizhi he huanjing</h2><p>Zhe ge chengzhen weiyue Yidali beibude Weinituo diqu, haiba yue 1224 mi.</p><h2>Gaoshan huaxue yichan</h2><p>Cortina ji shinian lai yizhi juxing zuigao jibie de <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">gaoshan huaxue</a> saishi.</p>", "ko": "<p>코르티나 담페초는 세계에서 가장 권위 있는 동계 스포츠 목적지 중 하나입니다. 이탈리아 돌로미테에 위치한 이 역사적인 리조트는 자연의 아름다움과 풍부한 스포츠 유산을 결합합니다.</p><h2>위치와 환경</h2><p>마을은 북부 이탈리아 베네토 지역의 해발 약 1,224미터에 위치해 있습니다.</p><h2>알파인 스키 유산</h2><p>코르티나는 수십 년 동안 최고 수준의 <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">알파인 스키</a> 이벤트를 개최해 왔습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'venue-guide',
